{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>By whose hand You will send.</b> By the hand of the one you are accustomed to send — and that is Aharon. Another interpretation: by the hand of another whom You would prefer to send — you have many emissaries; but in the end he would not be the one to bring them into the land and to be their redeemer in the future."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:28.399152532Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}